WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:04.837
-My first guest is
a 16-time WWE champion,

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:06.338
a best-selling author,

00:00:06.338 --> 00:00:09.342
and a talented actor,
who stars in "F9,"

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.210
which is in theaters
this Friday.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.546
Please welcome John Cena!

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.547
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:16.181
That's my man!

00:00:16.181 --> 00:00:18.684
That's what I'm talking about.
-Thank you very much.

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:20.587
-That's how you do it.
That's what I'm talking about.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:21.687
-No, no.
-Yes.

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:23.723
-I should do it --
Man, I wish I was there.

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.191
I really --
Seeing all the people

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.093
and seeing you in front of an
audience makes me feel great.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.295
I want to say hi to everybody.
I'm sorry I'm not there.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.331
I can't wait to be there
next time.

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:32.899
-You will. Oh, please.
You're the greatest.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.667
Come on.
I love that you dressed up, too.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:35.668
That is very cool. Thanks.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:37.536
-No, no, this is
what I slept in.

00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:38.705
-Oh, alright.
Sorry I thought -- Yeah.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:39.906
I apologize.

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:41.508
Hey, I want to congratulate
you on the air.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.776
Congratulations.
You got married, buddy.

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:45.010
That's awesome.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:47.680
I'm so happy for you.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.849
-Jimmy, you've met my wife
multiple times,

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.150
and I consider you
a true friend.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.519
You're the only one I'll say --

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:53.920
I'll accept a
congratulations from.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.421
-Yeah.

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:57.322
We were just
talking about wedding fails.

00:00:57.322 --> 00:00:58.591
We just did a hashtag.

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:01.060
Have you ever experienced
a wedding fail?

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.430
-Yeah, I think that's something,
kind of, we all have.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.498
Mine was my brother
Matt's wedding.

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.767
I thought it would be a nice
gesture to open the bar.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:08.901
Drinks are on me.

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.837
That's my gift to
the bride and groom,

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:12.305
that nobody would have to
pay for anything.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:16.876
So, I found out it was a mistake
when my brother Dan and I

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.145
got into a fistfight in
the middle of the dance floor

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.913
and closed the wedding down.

00:01:20.913 --> 00:01:22.915
-Oh, my God.
-Yeah.

00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:24.884
And you could tell
right then and there

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:27.653
who were guests and who were
a member of the Cena family,

00:01:27.653 --> 00:01:29.488
because the guests were like,
"Stop it!"

00:01:29.488 --> 00:01:32.525
And the Cena family's like, "No,
no, let them figure it out."

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:35.695
-Yeah, let them do that. Yeah.
-Let them do it.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.430
-Yeah, I want to
ask you about this,

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.365
'cause, you know, I follow you
on all the socials.

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:42.468
And you're a great follow.
And I follow you on Instagram.

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:43.869
There's rumors.

00:01:43.869 --> 00:01:47.507
There's rumors that
you're returning to the ring.

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:48.675
-Those rumors are true.

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:50.076
I'll be -- I'll definitely be
back to the WWE.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:53.179
I just -- I don't know when.

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:56.416
-Okay. But, so, this got fans
freaking out, okay?

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:59.986
-Yeah, so, I posted that
back in May.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.288
I was feeling rather
nostalgic about the WWE

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.656
and I just wanted to
post the logo.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:08.527
And some people took it as
I was returning immediately,

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:09.695
which that's not the case.

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:11.464
But I haven't had my last match

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:12.532
and I can't wait to have
my next one.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:14.300
-Well, you have
giant movies coming out.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:17.470
Like, giant, giant, giant films.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.105
-Well, I mean,
I'm very fortunate.

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:21.241
You know, "F9" is this week.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:23.409
I'm very excited they let people
back in theaters to see that.

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:27.079
[ Cheers and applause ]
-"Suicide Squad."

00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:29.649
-"Suicide Squad."
Currently filming "Peacemaker."

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:30.816
A comedy named
"Vacation Friends"

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:32.051
is coming out.

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:34.253
-"Vacation Friends"
looks awesome, by the way.

00:02:34.253 --> 00:02:36.756
-All these opportunities
have led to more opportunities.

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:40.159
So, I've said before, once you
do one of these things,

00:02:40.159 --> 00:02:42.595
the insurance doesn't let you go
wrestle on the weekends.

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:44.964
So we'll see what happens.

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:47.934
-"F9," like we said,
hits theaters Friday,

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:51.637
and people are going to come out
and go see movies again,

00:02:51.637 --> 00:02:53.172
if it's safe, which is great.

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:55.074
I think this is
the perfect movie for that.

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.777
You play Vin Diesel's brother.

00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:02.548
I saw on Vin's Instagram
when he kind of announced

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:04.817
that you were going to be --
How did it work?

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:06.953
Because Vin is very --
Like, he's very, kind of --

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:08.554
There's a lot of
mystique around him.

00:03:08.554 --> 00:03:09.988
I'll say, "How are you doing?"

00:03:09.988 --> 00:03:12.692
He's like,
"Isn't today beautiful?"

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:15.528
Yeah.

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:18.597
-So, your facial expression
was kind of like mine.

00:03:18.597 --> 00:03:20.666
I heard that Vin
wanted to talk to me.

00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:22.835
I knew nothing, like,
about what.

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:25.705
So, here I am in L.A.
on business,

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:28.274
dressed like this, and I go just
talk to Vin Diesel.

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:30.476
And we hung out for
a couple of hours.

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:31.677
We talked about
a bunch of stuff.

00:03:31.677 --> 00:03:34.146
And I thought it was
just really cool.

00:03:34.146 --> 00:03:35.781
And at the end,
he takes out his phone

00:03:35.781 --> 00:03:37.716
and films a social video.

00:03:37.716 --> 00:03:40.386
And if you go check this video
out, you can see me at the end.

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:42.020
-Yeah.
-And I'm like...

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.423
-[ Laughs ] Yeah.
Yeah, that's --

00:03:44.423 --> 00:03:46.325
-And I don't even know
what's going on.

00:03:46.325 --> 00:03:50.463
He didn't even let me
know afterwards, and I left.

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:52.532
I'm like, "Man, I just
hung out with Vin Diesel,"

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:53.933
and I thought that was
the end of it.

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:55.101
And then they called me later

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:58.103
and said they wanted me
to be in the "F9."

00:03:58.103 --> 00:04:00.973
And then he called me
later on and said,

00:04:00.973 --> 00:04:03.242
actually what I was doing,
which is, you know,

00:04:03.242 --> 00:04:05.144
being the brother of
Dom Toretto.

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:07.246
That's -- If you're a fan
of the universe,

00:04:07.246 --> 00:04:09.048
that's like your first match

00:04:09.048 --> 00:04:10.983
being in the main event
at WrestleMania.

00:04:10.983 --> 00:04:13.051
So I was really, really
excited about that,

00:04:13.051 --> 00:04:15.488
and the gravity of that
is certainly not lost on me.

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:18.657
-And did you guys --
Did you guys bond?

00:04:18.657 --> 00:04:20.893
-We did.
He's a wonderful human being.

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:24.363
And, man, like, his decision
has changed my life.

00:04:24.363 --> 00:04:27.967
And not only that,
the camaraderie and the family

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:29.535
on the "Fast" set is real.

00:04:29.535 --> 00:04:31.337
Like, everybody spends time
with everybody.

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:32.505
You got to remember,
these people have been

00:04:32.505 --> 00:04:34.473
doing business together
for 20 years.

00:04:34.473 --> 00:04:35.874
This is --
"Fast" just celebrated

00:04:35.874 --> 00:04:37.209
its 20th anniversary yesterday.

00:04:37.209 --> 00:04:38.244
-That's right.

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:39.379
-So it's only fitting that,
you know,

00:04:39.379 --> 00:04:41.180
we release "F9" this Friday

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.415
and get everybody
going to the theaters.

00:04:42.415 --> 00:04:44.717
But they've become
like a family,

00:04:44.717 --> 00:04:46.652
and it was so
welcoming and awesome.

00:04:46.652 --> 00:04:49.155
And, yeah, there was
some good, quality bonding.

00:04:49.155 --> 00:04:51.958
-You guys got some
good, scrappy fights in there.

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:55.294
-Yeah. So, you know, I think
I'm a good reference plate

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:57.095
that the more you
beat the tar out of a guy,

00:04:57.095 --> 00:04:59.231
the more, you know,
you tend to bond with him.

00:04:59.231 --> 00:05:00.933
In WWE,
that's kind of what we do.

00:05:00.933 --> 00:05:02.502
But, no, he --

00:05:02.502 --> 00:05:05.604
-Do you think he could
hold his own in the WWE?

00:05:05.604 --> 00:05:08.140
-He already has a name
and his name describes

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.708
his fighting style -- Diesel.

00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:11.577
-Diesel.
-He is a bull in a china shop.

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:13.078
I tell it like,
he is the most --

00:05:13.078 --> 00:05:15.348
Like you said, he's like --
He's got his own mystique

00:05:15.348 --> 00:05:18.517
and he's very loving
and warm and kind,

00:05:18.517 --> 00:05:19.652
but with the action stuff,

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:22.421
you can kind of see him
get in that zone.

00:05:22.421 --> 00:05:24.957
And I'm like,
"Yeah, this is...

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:26.325
Okay."
-Then you get scared.

00:05:26.325 --> 00:05:28.527
You go, "Oh, he's in character.
Alright, here we go."

00:05:28.527 --> 00:05:32.632
-Yeah, and then just it's really
energetic and it's --

00:05:32.632 --> 00:05:33.999
He would be a --

00:05:33.999 --> 00:05:36.102
You know, if the movie
biz doesn't work out for him,

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:38.170
he would be
a WWE champion for sure.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:41.474
-Yeah. I think he's doing okay.
Yeah.

00:05:41.474 --> 00:05:43.176
Should we set up the film
at all for anyone

00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:46.512
who doesn't know
the plot of "F9"?

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:48.147
-Yeah, I mean, here's the setup.

00:05:48.147 --> 00:05:51.550
Hey, guys, there's a
huge blockbuster, "F9,"

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.387
released on Friday, and
we've been without theaters

00:05:54.387 --> 00:05:57.122
and cinematic experiences for...

00:05:57.122 --> 00:05:58.791
way too long!

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:00.859
Go to the movie theater
and see this movie,

00:06:00.859 --> 00:06:02.495
'cause it's wonderful!

00:06:02.495 --> 00:06:05.364
Pay for the whole seat
and use only the edge!

00:06:05.364 --> 00:06:07.933
-That's what I'm talking --
Oh! That's what I'm talking...

00:06:07.933 --> 00:06:09.768
Is he a pro or what?

00:06:09.768 --> 00:06:13.139
"Use only the edge."
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:16.375
Here's John Cena
and Vin Diesel in "F9."

00:06:16.375 --> 00:06:17.744
Take a look at this.

00:06:50.209 --> 00:06:52.945
-That's what I'm talking about!
John Cena, everybody!

00:06:52.945 --> 00:06:55.748
-We actually re-created my
brother Matt's wedding for that.

